                                                "sense_id": "c9a15988-096b-3b8e-83df-258722db15b3",
                                                "text": "But it took Mayor Michael R. Bloomberg, the multibillionaire with a reputation for cool-headedness, to actually bar him, beginning in April, from City Hall news conferences."
                                            }
